<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Jumbo Score Madagascar | Accueil</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Découvrez le catalogue Jumbo Score Madagascar et consultez les produits disponibles.">

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --jumbo-red: #e31e24;
            --jumbo-red-dark: #b8171c;
            --jumbo-yellow: #ffcf00;
            --jumbo-navy: #17213e;
            --jumbo-gray: #f5f6f8;
            --jumbo-white: #ffffff;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
            scroll-padding-top: 90px;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: var(--jumbo-navy);
            background: var(--jumbo-white);
        }

        a {
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        /* Barre d'information */
        .top-bar {
            background: var(--jumbo-navy);
            color: white;
            padding: 9px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .top-bar i {
            color: var(--jumbo-yellow);
        }

        /* Navigation */
        .main-navbar {
            background: white;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 18px rgba(23, 33, 62, 0.09);
        }

        .navbar-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 25px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .navbar-brand img {
            max-width: 155px;
            max-height: 58px;
            object-fit: contain;
        }

        .brand-fallback {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
        }

        .brand-mark {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            background: var(--jumbo-red);
            color: white;
            border-bottom: 5px solid var(--jumbo-yellow);
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 23px;
        }

        .navbar-nav .nav-link {
            color: var(--jumbo-navy);
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 12px 14px !important;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .navbar-nav .nav-link:hover {
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
        }

        .btn-jumbo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--jumbo-red);
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-jumbo:hover {
            background: var(--jumbo-red-dark);
            color: white;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-jumbo-outline {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border: 2px solid white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 11px 20px;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 800;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-jumbo-outline:hover {
            background: white;
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
        }

        /* Grande bannière */
        .hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 500px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: var(--jumbo-navy);
            color: white;
        }

        .hero-image {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            animation: heroAppear 0.8s ease-out;
        }

        .hero::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            inset: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                rgba(17, 25, 48, 0.94) 0%,
                rgba(17, 25, 48, 0.75) 48%,
                rgba(17, 25, 48, 0.18) 100%
            );
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            padding-top: 70px;
            padding-bottom: 70px;
        }

        .hero-label {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--jumbo-yellow);
            color: var(--jumbo-navy);
            border-radius: 5px;
            padding: 8px 13px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            max-width: 700px;
            font-size: clamp(35px, 5vw, 60px);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.08;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--jumbo-yellow);
        }

        .hero p {
            max-width: 570px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .hero-decoration {
            position: absolute;
            z-index: 2;
            right: 5%;
            bottom: 25px;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        @keyframes heroAppear {
            from { opacity: 0.55; transform: scale(1.03); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }

        /* Avantages */
        .benefits {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            margin-top: -1px;
            background: white;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eceef2;
        }

        .benefit-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 25px 12px;
            height: 100%;
        }

        .benefit-icon {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 48px;
            height: 48px;
            background: #fff0f0;
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 23px;
        }

        .benefit-item h3 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin: 0 0 5px;
        }

        .benefit-item p {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #697184;
            margin: 0;
        }

        /* Titres de sections */
        .section {
            padding: 75px 0;
        }

        .section-soft {
            background: var(--jumbo-gray);
        }

        .section-eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 1.8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: var(--jumbo-navy);
            font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 39px);
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .section-description {
            color: #6b7280;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 650px;
        }

        /* Catalogue */
        .catalogue-heading {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: end;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .product-card {
            height: 100%;
            background: white;
            border: 1px solid #eaecf0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.25s, box-shadow 0.25s;
        }

        .product-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(23, 33, 62, 0.1);
        }

        .product-image-wrap {
            height: 215px;
            background: #f5f6f8;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .product-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain;
            padding: 15px;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .product-card:hover .product-image {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .product-placeholder {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            color: #a1a7b3;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        .product-placeholder i {
            font-size: 45px;
        }

        .product-body {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .product-category {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #fff0f0;
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 5px 8px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .product-name {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--jumbo-navy);
        }

        .product-description {
            color: #747b8a;
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            min-height: 44px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .product-bottom {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eceef2;
            padding-top: 15px;
        }

        .product-price {
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .stock-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #667085;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .stock-label i {
            color: #16834a;
        }

        .empty-catalogue {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 55px 20px;
            background: white;
            border: 1px dashed #d4d8e0;
            border-radius: 14px;
        }

        .empty-catalogue i {
            font-size: 50px;
            color: #a4aab6;
        }

        /* Bandeau promotionnel */
        .promo-section {
            padding: 65px 0;
            background: var(--jumbo-red);
            color: white;
        }

        .promo-section h2 {
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 40px);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .promo-section p {
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .promo-icon {
            font-size: 85px;
            color: var(--jumbo-yellow);
            text-align: center;
        }

        /* À propos */
        .about-icon {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 300px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--jumbo-navy), #293b68);
            border-radius: 18px;
            color: var(--jumbo-yellow);
            font-size: 115px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .about-icon::before,
        .about-icon::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            border: 25px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
            border-radius: 50%;
        }

        .about-icon::before {
            top: -65px;
            left: -55px;
        }

        .about-icon::after {
            bottom: -75px;
            right: -45px;
        }

        .about-icon i {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .about-point {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .about-point i {
            color: var(--jumbo-red);
            font-size: 21px;
        }

        .about-point strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .about-point p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #697184;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        /* Pied de page */
        .footer {
            padding-top: 55px;
            background: var(--jumbo-navy);
            color: white;
        }

        .footer-brand {
            color: white;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .footer-description {
            max-width: 370px;
            color: #c4cad7;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .footer h4 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 900;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .footer-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #c4cad7;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            color: var(--jumbo-yellow);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            margin-top: 45px;
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
            color: #c4cad7;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 767px) {
            .top-bar {
                font-size: 11px;
            }

            .hero {
                min-height: 470px;
            }

            .hero-content {
                padding-top: 55px;
                padding-bottom: 55px;
            }

            .hero::after {
                background: rgba(17, 25, 48, 0.78);
            }

            .hero-decoration {
                display: none;
            }

            .section {
                padding: 55px 0;
            }

            .product-image-wrap {
                height: 180px;
            }

            .about-icon {
                min-height: 220px;
                font-size: 85px;
            }

            .benefit-item {
                padding: 15px 5px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

{# Images locales : une image différente peut apparaître à chaque actualisation #}
{% set imagesJumbo = [
    'images/jumbo/jumbo-1.jpg',
    'images/jumbo/jumbo-2.jpg',
    'images/jumbo/jumbo-3.jpg',
    'images/jumbo/jumbo-4.jpg'
] %}

{% set imageJumbo = random(imagesJumbo) %}

<!-- Barre d'information -->
<div class="top-bar">
    <div class="container d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2">
        <span>
            <i class="bi bi-geo-alt-fill me-1"></i>
            Jumbo Score Madagascar
        </span>
        <span>
            <i class="bi bi-bag-check-fill me-1"></i>
            Découvrez notre catalogue de produits
        </span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Navigation -->
<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg main-navbar">
    <div class="container">

        <a class="navbar-brand" href="{{ path('app_home') }}" aria-label="Accueil Jumbo Score">
            <img
                src="{{ asset('images/jumbo-score-logo.png') }}"
                alt="Jumbo Score"
                onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='inline-flex';"
            >
            <span class="brand-fallback" style="display:none;">
                <span class="brand-mark"><i class="bi bi-shop"></i></span>
                JUMBO SCORE
            </span>
        </a>

        <button
            class="navbar-toggler"
            type="button"
            data-bs-toggle="collapse"
            data-bs-target="#mainNavigation"
            aria-controls="mainNavigation"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-label="Ouvrir la navigation"
        >
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>

        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNavigation">
            <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-lg-center">
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="{{ path('app_home') }}">Accueil</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#catalogue">Catalogue</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#avantages">Nos avantages</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a class="nav-link" href="#apropos">À propos</a>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item ms-lg-2 mt-2 mt-lg-0">
                    <a class="btn-jumbo" href="{{ path('app_login') }}">
                        <i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i>
                        Connexion
                    </a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

    </div>
</nav>

<!-- Grande bannière Jumbo Score -->
<header class="hero">
    <img
        class="hero-image"
        src="{{ asset(imageJumbo) }}"
        alt="Découverte du supermarché Jumbo Score Madagascar"
        fetchpriority="high"
    >

    <div class="container hero-content">
        <span class="hero-label">
            <i class="bi bi-star-fill me-1"></i>
            Bienvenue chez Jumbo Score
        </span>

        <h1>
            Tout ce qu'il vous faut,
            <span>au même endroit.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
            Découvrez notre catalogue de produits et consultez les informations
            disponibles. Retrouvez facilement les articles qui vous intéressent
            grâce à une présentation simple et agréable.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#catalogue" class="btn-jumbo">
                Découvrir le catalogue
                <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
            </a>

            <a href="#apropos" class="btn-jumbo-outline">
                En savoir plus
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-decoration">
        JUMBO SCORE · MADAGASCAR
    </div>
</header>

<!-- Avantages -->
<section class="benefits" id="avantages">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">

            <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="benefit-item">
                    <div class="benefit-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-basket2"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Grand choix</h3>
                        <p>Un catalogue varié</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="benefit-item">
                    <div class="benefit-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-tags"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Prix consultables</h3>
                        <p>Les prix affichés en ligne</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="benefit-item">
                    <div class="benefit-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Stock affiché</h3>
                        <p>Quantités renseignées au catalogue</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="benefit-item">
                    <div class="benefit-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-phone"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3>Simple à consulter</h3>
                        <p>Sur ordinateur et mobile</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Catalogue -->
<section class="section section-soft" id="catalogue">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="catalogue-heading">
            <div>
                <span class="section-eyebrow">Notre sélection</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">Catalogue de produits</h2>
                <p class="section-description mb-0">
                    Retrouvez ci-dessous les produits enregistrés dans notre catalogue.
                </p>
            </div>

            <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-jumbo">
                <i class="bi bi-person-lock"></i>
                Accès à l'espace de gestion
            </a>
        </div>

        {% if produits is defined and produits|length > 0 %}

            <div class="row g-4">
                {% for produit in produits %}
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-4 col-xl-3">
                        <article class="product-card">

                            <div class="product-image-wrap">
                                {% if produit.image is defined and produit.image %}
                                    <img
                                        class="product-image"
                                        src="{{ asset('images/produits/' ~ produit.image) }}"
                                        alt="{{ produit.nom }}"
                                        loading="lazy"
                                    >
                                {% else %}
                                    <div class="product-placeholder">
                                        <i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i>
                                        <span>Image non disponible</span>
                                    </div>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>

                            <div class="product-body">
                                <span class="product-category">
                                    <i class="bi bi-bag me-1"></i>
                                    Produit
                                </span>

                                <h3 class="product-name">
                                    {{ produit.nom }}
                                </h3>

                                <p class="product-description">
                                    {% if produit.description is defined and produit.description %}
                                        {{ produit.description|length > 95
                                            ? produit.description|slice(0, 95) ~ '…'
                                            : produit.description }}
                                    {% else %}
                                        Découvrez ce produit dans notre catalogue.
                                    {% endif %}
                                </p>

                                <div class="product-bottom">
                                    <div class="product-price">
                                        {% if produit.prixVente is defined and produit.prixVente is not null %}
                                            {{ produit.prixVente|number_format(0, ',', ' ') }} Ar
                                        {% else %}
                                            Prix non renseigné
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </div>

                                </div>
                            </div>

                        </article>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
            </div>

        {% else %}

            <div class="empty-catalogue">
                <i class="bi bi-inboxes"></i>
                <h3 class="mt-3 fw-bold">Le catalogue est en préparation</h3>
                <p class="text-secondary mb-4">
                    Aucun produit n'est disponible à l'affichage pour le moment.
                </p>
                <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn-jumbo">
                    <i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i>
                    Se connecter
                </a>
            </div>

        {% endif %}

    </div>
</section>

<!-- Bandeau rouge -->
<section class="promo-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
            <div class="col-lg-8">
                <h2>Découvrez notre catalogue en quelques clics.</h2>
                <p>
                    Consultez les produits présentés sur notre site et accédez
                    à l'espace de gestion si vous disposez d'un compte autorisé.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-4 text-lg-end">
                <a href="{{ path('app_login') }}" class="btn btn-light fw-bold px-4 py-3">
                    Accéder à mon compte
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-2"></i>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- À propos -->
<section class="section" id="apropos">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center g-5">

            <div class="col-lg-5">
                <div class="about-icon">
                    <i class="bi bi-shop-window"></i>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-7">
                <span class="section-eyebrow">À propos</span>
                <h2 class="section-title">
                    Bienvenue dans l'univers Jumbo Score
                </h2>

                <p class="section-description">
                    Cette page vous permet de découvrir les produits présentés
                    dans notre catalogue et de consulter les informations
                    disponibles sur chacun d'eux.
                </p>

                <div class="about-point">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Un catalogue facile à parcourir</strong>
                        <p>Les produits sont présentés avec leur nom, leur description et leur prix lorsqu'ils sont renseignés.</p>
                    </div>
